aver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/revaraver/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/revaraver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/revaraver/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/revaraver/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/revaraver/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/revaraver/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/revaraver/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-22T19:21:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T19:21:39Z","body":"观察了一下其他软件都是在预输入状态下,鼠标点击界面后会清空ime状态,可能把源代码中的对应部分的处理代码apply_ime改成cancel_ime比较妥当,在此备注留给之后的修复以供参考\n\n但是在vscode中,点击后不会清空ime的输入而是保持之前带有单引号的上屏, 个人感觉保持这样也可以","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3320991497/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329096047","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110138#issuecomment-3329096047","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110138","id":3329096047,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Gbflv","user":{"login":"Jiayibingping","id":138685418,"node_id":"U_kgDOCEQr6g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138685418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping","html_url":"https://github.com/Jiayibingping","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T14:57:05Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T14:57:05Z","body":"\n\n\n\n\n> > https://github.com/revaraver/godot/releases/tag/4.5 试试这个如何\n> \n> 我的修复只修复了输出框的这些爆红错误,也就是case3,感觉已经不影响日常使用了. 至于你说的前两种case,个人感觉是可以接受的特性, 也不知道怎么修为好. 因为ime状态不只是中文会有,日语韩语也会有, 中文输入大可以直接通过检测到鼠标点击时发送一个enter来让预输入的字母上屏完毕(也就是删掉单引号),但是这种操作大概率不会适用于其他语言的ime\n\n其实 有一个严重的问题让特性不能成为特性——就是**case2**，在搜索（Search In File...）的时候如果用case1的特性打拉丁字母，拉丁字母无法识别！只有增加或者删减才能被戈多识别……我怀疑是隐藏的分割号“ ‘ ”。 之所以想把case1提到的分割号去除，是因为戈多的内置IDE里 分割号是字符串关键字。会变成黄色……\n\n<img width=\"174\" height=\"83\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e66d6abc-31af-4f65-bef5-b74c819ccbfe\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329096047/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3414526788","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110138#issuecomment-3414526788","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110138","id":3414526788,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LhYtE","user":{"login":"MadeScientist","id":190612698,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1yE2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190612698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist","html_url":"https://github.com/MadeScientist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/user